[00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.800]   - Uh, keep your head down and keep moving.
[00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.720]   - Get down, keep moving.
[00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.840]   - Listen to your NCOs.
[00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:49.840]   - Thanks.
[00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.440]   - What's in NCO?
