[00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.740]   - Do you see whoever it is, Colin, so late in the evening?
[00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:26.740]   - Yes, ma'am.
[00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.740]   (dramatic music)
[00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.420]   - It's a man, and a uniform man.
[00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.420]   (dramatic music)
[00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:59.680]   (laughing)
[00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:04.920]   - Sydney, Bella, oh, father, sit here.
[00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.920]   - I hope I didn't startle you, Mr. Sledge.
[00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.080]   - Oh, not at all.
[00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.580]   - Who the hell is this standing in my hallway?
[00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:11.880]   - It's Sydney.
[00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.420]   - Dr. Sledge.
[00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.420]   - It's my pal, look out there.
[00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.420]   Thank you, Rose.
[00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.220]   I want you to speak frankly about my Eugene.
[00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:27.220]   How is he here?
[00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:30.200]   - I don't put the boy on the spa.
[00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.000]   - Mrs. Sledge, Eugene's with a lot of good Marines.
[00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.260]   First is the best there is.
[00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.400]   They're great guys too.
[00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.000]   They look after each other.
[00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.340]   Besides that, well, he's a mortar man, same as me.
[00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:48.040]   I stove pipe boys, we're always a little behind the hot stuff,
[00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:51.480]   which is a good place to be, let me tell you.
[00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:55.720]   No, I can't say this about every Marina I know,
[00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:59.020]   but I'm not worried about Eugene.
[00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:02.060]   - See, father?
[00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:04.660]   That's not so hot to hear, is it?
[00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.660]   (dramatic music)
[00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.480]   (dramatic music)
[00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.480]   (gunshot)
[00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.480]   - Take him to the garden, get up here.
[00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:01.480]   (dramatic music)
[00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:07.480]   (dramatic music)
[00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:11.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:16.480]   (dramatic music)
[00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:22.480]   - What the hell are you doing?
[00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.480]   Break this shit down, get ready to move.
[00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:30.480]   (gunshot)
[00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:32.480]   (gunshot)
